	"Description": "Traversal surface data contract: which mechanics a collider offers (wall slide, wall climb, launch, stand), its impact class (Surface.Type.*) and its launch parameters, resolved from a hit by component, provider interface, physical material table or default. Pure data and stateless resolution (GSTNSurfaceCore): no GAS, Network Prediction or Mover, so it needs no fork. Enabling it changes nothing until a designer marks a surface.",
